{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"She smiles, \"I appreciate it Rockman, Kiln, but it's not outside stuff that scares me about places like this. It's inside.\" She taps her head. \"Goblin are taught from birth to stay away from certain places and people. Told we're not welcome or that people will hurt us if we come near. You all are lovely, and my tribe left me a long time ago, but things like are still kind of... In there. I don't do it on purpose, but it's why I never really went into pubs and stayed away from the Knights for so long.\" She sighs","created_at":"2020-08-07T20:55:52.217000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741399235257434212","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"Rockman stands and grabs the hilt of his Greataxe. Visibly no longer using a sword and shield. He leans down to Leaf and speaks in goblin || \"I dare ANYONE to harm you at all. You come tell me if someone does!\" || He smiles and whistles to Rush2.0 they run out waving to them and smiling happily. Rush2.0 jumps and barks along side him.","created_at":"2020-08-07T20:59:09.671000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741400063439405059","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
