{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"Web smiles. \"Faith sometimes all we have. Will be enough.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T07:20:13.659000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743368299261460551","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"They pull out a small notebook, as their mood becomes more serious. \"Hunger? The masons? Web want to know everything Florian allowed to tell. Can promise nothing Florian says leave this room unless Florian approve.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T07:21:51.396000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743368709199888436","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"The Hunger is an ancient being from the Abyss, it 'as ze ability to warp the creatures around it and to consume divinity. It hungers for le divine energy in all beings. Gods are a larger meal for them-\" he shakes his head\n\"Where to begin... Are you familiar with their cycle? The Sibriex and Croatoan that grew as it consumed?\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T07:27:23.604000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743370102581231627","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"Web shakes their hand in a 'so-so' motion. \"Know that a cycle exists, and that Sibirex from abyss? Know barrier affects length of cycle, is much shorter in old world.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T07:28:48.541000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743370458833092608","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"Oui, the time here is faster than it is in ze old world. Lady Lilia was supposed to arrive a day before le Tir Na Nog, yet has been here for over a year. Time shifts. In the outer world it does seem to be every 50 years.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T07:30:58.013000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743371001877757953","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"Long ago there was a moment. The Great Old One, Cthulhu had plans to Usurp the power from the gods that stood on the Celestial Mountains. It drew the attention of the Croatoan, one of the kings of the Abyssal Planes, into their realm somehow. The Croatoan emerged in some sort of trick and began to consume all it could. Ze gods fought and plunged back into the material plane, over the city of Mantapolis and passed the barrier of the divine. The Croatoan was able to kill them or corrupt them, one by one until they had all fallen. Bahamut was left with a fragment of his mind, later trapped. Not all of the gods fell there however, several of them, or their remnant essences made it to the island.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T07:35:58.858000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743372263713144884","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"Web nods, taking notes on the new information.","created_at":"2020-08-13T07:42:27.970000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743373895767162900","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"The divinity in our world was lost and for the last few hundred years, our living memory has been of emptiness and pain. With evil gods left unchecked, or worshippers of the corrupted driven mad, the world was left without hope except for the remnants of their divine sparks.\n\nThe hunger's cycle continued time and time again. 50 years ago, or hundreds by the island's time, the Masons attempted to banish it back, only for it to continue the cycle. They had won but not for long. The Knights formed not long after this after a member of the Masons left. The barrier has since kept the Hunger in this side of the world, but is broken. The two choices came from that- Repair the barrier and keep the Wardens of this realm in control, or to find a way to kill it without a chance of it returning. Over these cycles it comes back stronger, new forms, new power.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T07:43:52.848000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743374251771428917","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"The Wardens gave the last colony of Roanoke ze aid they needed to banish it at the Hanging Tree, which now stands corrupted.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T07:44:53.328000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743374505442934796","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"Web nods. \"Was given a vision of that fight. Assume the knights wish to kill it. That what artifacts are for? Why they important?\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T07:50:32.086000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743375926296969226","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"I need you to do one thing. I don't know if you're still with them, and I can't tell if I can trust you.\"\n\nHe takes out Excalibur in her repaired glory and sets it down on the table. He puts his hand over it and it begins to glow a faint white light.\n\n\"Place your hand over mine. Excalibur will work through me to see if you are telling the truth. I have one question to ask.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T07:57:19.211000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743377633903116289","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"Thought she could only work for those joining?\" Web says. They pause. \"Web trust Florian. So long as no ask to tell Mason secrets, can ask as many questions as want.\" They place their hand over his.","created_at":"2020-08-13T07:59:28.696000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-13T08:01:02.324000Z","id":"743378177002569798","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"It will work for me\"\n\nHe whispers under his breath\n\"I hope...\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T08:01:32.060000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743378694428426300","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
