{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"You feel a tickle in your mind but do not hear the voice of Excalibur, it is the voice of Florian as if a mind link, however something else effects the link. Florian's voice seems to echo in a clear determined way, as if affected by the sword, but it does not seem to last long.\n||Are you with the Golden Dawn, and do you wish to Subvert the Knights. Was tonight, your doing?||","created_at":"2020-08-13T08:03:57.304000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743379303625916456","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"Web shakes their head, then pauses. ||I do not serve the golden dawn, though Solomon still holds power over me. The petrification his doing, as was other memory loss. Do not wish to subvert the knights. Tonight was not my doing, though worry could be to blame. Without my presence or magic, Lolth likely never have found Melora. I am sorry.||","created_at":"2020-08-13T08:06:02.519000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743379828815953950","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
